#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SD9702 expect=noViolation domain=TS
# Rule:Description: FDA-SD9702 — the Required key TSPARM is not populated.
#note "TSPARM populated -> noViolation; the twin scenario differs only in the value of TSPARM."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset TS
col STUDYID type=Char
col DOMAIN type=Char
col TSSEQ type=Char
col TSPARMCD type=Char
col TSPARM type=Char
col TSVAL type=Char
---
S1      | TS     | 1     | TITLE    | Trial Title | A Study
---
